&lt;li&gt;Own the overall architecture and technical strategy for Anaplan’s predictive intelligence services across multiple verticalised solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a unified architectural approach across disparate intelligence services, reducing duplication and establishing shared platform primitives for forecasting, model serving, and data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
